  "description": "Inspired by Turkish kereviz salatası, this crunchy celery root salad swaps yogurt for a bright lemon vinaigrette with apples and walnuts.",
  "notes": "Make-ahead and storage: The vinaigrette can be made up to 3 days ahead and refrigerated in an airtight container. Whisk well before using.\nThe salad is best eaten right away. For the best texture, add the walnuts just before serving. Once the celeriac and apple are cut, the salad should be dressed right away to prevent oxidation.\nLeftovers can be refrigerated in an airtight container for up to 2 days.",
